  "description_snippet": "**Tested on:** V8 14.9.0 (candidate), HEAD `31b353261e41a9d15c829359b0d4d9e261debeb6` (2026-04-04)\n\n`BuildCheckSmi` elides the runtime Smi check when `TryGetInt32Constant` returns a value in Smi range. `TryGetInt32Constant` recurses through the `checked_value` alternative recorded by `SetKnownValue`"
